The reason for the 'Memory fault' is the impropper use
of time(3) in slave.c at line 322.

It was:
        srand(time() % 10);
        sleep(rand() % 10);

It should be:
        srand(time(0L) % 10);
        sleep(rand() % 10);

	
	Note the missing '0L' in the first case.

